<title>USA: ViaSat gets $20.7 mln defense contract.</title>
<headline>ViaSat gets $20.7 mln defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ViaSat Inc said it landed a U.S. Department of Defense contract for two joint communication simulators valued at about $20.7 million.</p>
<p>ViaSat designs and produces advanced digital satellite telecommunications and wireless signal processing equipment for government and commercial markets.</p>
<p>ViaSat gained 1-3/8 to 10-7/8 in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
